# public key (to secure APIs etc)
Server init.

# generate keys
>> keys := Nkhokwe-yotetezedwa panga-makiyi.

# private (secret) key
>> sk := keys choyamba.

# public key
>> pk := keys chomaliza.

# sign a message
>> sig := Nkhokwe-yotetezedwa saina: ['abc'] ndi: sk.

Zotuluka lembani: sig kutalika, mzere-watsopano.